# Device adapter

All wearables implement `DeviceAdapter`. UI never imports a vendor module.

- Emit **raw** normalized samples only (HR, steps, sleep epochs, …). Derived scores belong to algorithms.
- `FakeDeviceAdapter` ships before any Xiaomi BLE work.
- `src/devices/xiaomi` stays empty until BLE is approved. No BLE packages until then.
- Band 9 capabilities are `unknown` until `docs/DEVICE_CAPABILITIES.md` is updated from research (not from copied AGPL code).

```ts
// ❌ BAD
await xiaomiClient.getRecoveryScore();

// ✅ GOOD
const samples = await adapter.sync(); // HeartRateSample[]
await ingestRaw(samples);
```
